//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Tech: everything army-related off, then the pick's unit, morph chain and own upgrades back on.
// Ported from the old arcade map. Queens stay buildable by every Zerg with no cap; Ravens stay
// buildable by every Terran but can't use abilities unless picked; Medivacs stay buildable by every
// Terran (they carry SCVs too) and can boost (with Rapid Reignition) but never heal.
//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
void MB_DisallowEverything (int lp_player) {
    // Unit upgrades newer than the old map, gated to their pick in MB_Unlock.
